<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Design Pattern on Study Notes</title><link>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/design_pattern/</link><description>Recent content in Design Pattern on Study Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/design_pattern/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/design_pattern/strategy_pattern/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kimchioverfit.github.io/Study/design_pattern/strategy_pattern/</guid><description>&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;typedef&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;Strategy)(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; b) { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; b; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;mul&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; b) { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; b; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;execute&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; b, Strategy s) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; cout &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Result: &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; s(a, b) &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; endl;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;execute(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;, add); &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// 결과: 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;execute(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;, mul); &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// 결과: 12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;위 케이스처럼, 실행 시점에 알고리즘을 선택하게 할 수도 있음.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>